                                "sense_id": "41e22b56-79a5-36ca-8e05-882a6ca93d9d",
                                "text": "The big elliptical main hall, quite a beautiful saloon, looked at first sight like a German show, for the hakenkreuzes, or swastikas, on the tails of the German aeroplanes, and a frieze of the same emblem round most of the gallery[…]"
