                                "sense_id": "41e22b56-79a5-36ca-8e05-882a6ca93d9d",
                                "text": "A prominent US-based Hindu organization has urged Canadian Prime Minister Justin Trudeau and Indian-origin leader Jagmeet Singh not to conflate the ‘Swastika’, an ancient and auspicious symbol for Hindus with the ‘Hakenkreuz’, a 20th century Nazi symbol of hate."
                            },
                            {
